{
  "name": "DocHub demo: update status from webhook",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Update status when signing finishes\n\nTurn this workflow **Active**. n8n registers a DocHub webhook for `document.status_changed`. When a sign request reaches a terminal status (`FINALIZED`, `REJECTED`, `VOIDED`, or `EXPIRED`), this finds the row whose **sent** URL contains that document id, writes the new status into **status**, and writes this execution's time into **timestamp**.\n\nBefore activating on n8n Cloud:\n1. The **DocHub** community node is installed.\n2. **DocHub Trigger** uses the **DocHub API** credential. The key needs permission to create webhooks.\n3. Both Google Sheets nodes use an account that can edit [the spreadsheet](https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID/edit).\n\nDocHub does not send this event for in-progress updates. Turning the workflow off deletes the webhook. n8n Cloud already has a public HTTPS URL, so no tunnel is required.",
        "height": 340,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-40, -420],
      "id": "d5b2f8c1-7e35-4a2b-8d42-1f6c9b8e2001",
      "name": "How to run this demo"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "events": ["document.status_changed"]
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-dochub.docHubTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [0, 0],
      "id": "d5b2f8c1-7e35-4a2b-8d42-1f6c9b8e2002",
      "name": "DocHub Trigger"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "has-document-id",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data?.document?.id }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "has-new-status",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.data?.new_status }}",
              "rightValue": "",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "notEmpty",
                "singleValue": true
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [280, 0],
      "id": "d5b2f8c1-7e35-4a2b-8d42-1f6c9b8e2003",
      "name": "Has document status"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "authentication": "oAuth2",
        "resource": "sheet",
        "operation": "read",
        "documentId": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "https://docs.google.com/spreadsheets/d/YOUR_SPREADSHEET_ID/edit",
          "mode": "url"
        },
        "sheetName": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "0",
          "mode": "id"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.googleSheets",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [560, 0],
      "id": "d5b2f8c1-7e35-4a2b-8d42-1f6c9b8e2004",
      "name": "Read signers"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "loose",
            "version": 2
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "sent-contains-document",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.sent }}",
              "rightValue": "={{ $('DocHub Trigger').first().json.data.document.id }}",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "contains"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.filter",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [840, 0],
      "id": "d5b2f8c1-7e35-4a2b-8d42-1f6c9b8e2005",
      "name": "Matching sent URL"
    },
    {
